            <p style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 24px;max-width:66ch;">Most likely, yes. Perimenopause can begin in your early forties — often years before the word menopause feels like it belongs to you. If you're noticing changes in sleep, mood, bloating, or temperature and a doctor has told you your labs are "normal," this formula was built for exactly that window.*</p>
